{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50980","headline":"赠贾黄中（贾以七岁应童子举） · 李昉","name":"赠贾黄中（贾以七岁应童子举）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"七岁神童古所难，贾家门户有衣冠。\n十人科第排头上，五部经书诵舌端。\n见榜不知名字贵，登筵未识管弦欢。\n从今稳上青云去，万里谁能测羽翰。\n（见《宋诗纪事》引《闻见前录》。\n）（见《邵多闻见录》卷六。\n）（望按：贾黄中字娲民，南皮人。\n生後晋天福六年，卒宋太宗至道二年。\n《宋史》卷二六五有传。\n诗注云「七岁应童子举」，则时当晋天福十二年，尚未入宋也。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李昉","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50980.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50980","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}